      "writtenOn": "2025-04-11T18:35:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To keep the pattern consistent with Graphite and Ganesh, I would have these be on `SkRasterContext` w/ forward declarations and the it friends `SkRasterContextPriv` so that internal code can access things, e.g. `context-\u003epriv().resourceCache()`.",
